WEBVTT

00:01.501 --> 00:03.545
EASTERN DAWN BRIGADE HEADQUARTERS

00:05.672 --> 00:07.215
We're under attack!

00:07.298 --> 00:10.051
All operational Knightmares, engage now!

00:19.811 --> 00:22.355
Less than worthless.

00:22.439 --> 00:25.358
I know that Knightmare.
It's Narah Vaughn's!

00:25.734 --> 00:26.860
Damn it!

00:26.943 --> 00:30.113
All units! Fall back now!

00:31.531 --> 00:32.782
NORTH WOLF ARMY HEADQUARTERS

00:32.866 --> 00:35.201
<i>Evacuate the base!
I repeat, evacuate!</i>

00:35.285 --> 00:36.286
<i>Roger!</i>

00:44.878 --> 00:45.879
<i>Scissorman?</i>

00:45.962 --> 00:48.339
Huh? They've deployed him already?

00:49.591 --> 00:50.759
<i>Sir Christoph.</i>

00:50.842 --> 00:53.720
<i>How should we handle the terrorists
that are running away?</i>

00:53.803 --> 00:55.096
Let's see...

00:55.180 --> 00:57.432
Why don't we go ahead and crush them.

00:58.016 --> 00:59.225
SEVEN SHINING STARS OTARU HIDEOUT

00:59.309 --> 01:01.186
<i>Enemy units moving south
along the waterfront.</i>

01:01.269 --> 01:02.604
<i>They're closing in on Nakabashi.</i>

01:02.687 --> 01:06.357
Roger. Oda and Munemori,
start moving to the point now.

01:06.441 --> 01:07.442
Yes, sir!

01:08.735 --> 01:10.070
<i>Hostiles, 12 o'clock!</i>

01:15.617 --> 01:19.037
Greetings from one of the Einbergs.
I am Heath Lott.

01:19.579 --> 01:22.665
<i>We're annihilating
the Seven Shining Stars!</i>

01:23.291 --> 01:25.043
<i>All enemy units on the move!</i>

01:25.126 --> 01:26.419
<i>Keep drawing them in.</i>

01:26.503 --> 01:27.504
<i>On it!</i>

01:28.546 --> 01:30.840
Rozé, what is your current status?

01:30.924 --> 01:33.343
Hmm? Ready whenever you are.

01:34.761 --> 01:35.845
Then let's begin.

01:35.929 --> 01:36.930
Hmm.

01:37.639 --> 01:38.640
<i>All right, then!</i>

01:38.723 --> 01:40.600
<i>Operation Rat Trap...</i>

01:40.934 --> 01:42.143
<i>commence!</i>

01:42.227 --> 01:43.228
<i>Roger.</i>

03:17.488 --> 03:18.698
BLACK KNIGHTS HACHINOHE BASE

03:18.781 --> 03:21.659
<i>The North Wolf Army
and the Eastern Dawn Brigade have fallen.</i>

03:21.743 --> 03:25.872
<i>So two of the resistance forces
within Hokkaido have now been eliminated.</i>

03:25.955 --> 03:28.917
<i>Indeed, Neo-Britannia's
military cannot be underestimated.</i>

03:29.000 --> 03:30.001
Now just a moment.

03:30.752 --> 03:33.463
Kensei Kuroto leads
the Seven Shining Stars.

03:33.546 --> 03:35.340
They repelled the enemy.

03:35.423 --> 03:39.969
<i>Yes, but the three Einbergs that were
killed were low-ranking members at best.</i>

03:40.053 --> 03:42.347
<i>There are still
several high-ranking Einbergs</i>

03:42.430 --> 03:44.891
<i>and most of the Neo-Britannian army
remains intact.</i>

03:44.974 --> 03:45.975
I'm aware.

03:46.059 --> 03:50.063
<i>What's more, we haven't forgotten
the two previous attempts at liberation</i>

03:50.146 --> 03:52.398
<i>conducted by the Black Knights
that ended in failure.</i>

03:52.482 --> 03:53.566
Hmm.

03:54.275 --> 03:56.569
<i>And what about your claim
that the Situmpe Wall</i>

03:56.653 --> 03:58.154
<i>was the key to freeing Hokkaido?</i>

03:58.238 --> 04:00.031
We're still analyzing it.

04:00.615 --> 04:04.410
<i>I see. So you've yet to establish
an effective approach.</i>

04:05.161 --> 04:07.956
<i>It's hard for me to believe
that Norland von Lunebelg</i>

04:08.039 --> 04:12.418
<i>is one to be satisfied with simply leaving
this as an attempt to stir the pot.</i>

04:12.502 --> 04:16.506
<i>Commander, the person
we are dealing with is a madman</i>

04:16.589 --> 04:19.801
<i>who sent back an entire peace envoy
in body bags.</i>

04:19.884 --> 04:23.096
<i>I sincerely hope this will be
the last time I need to remind you.</i>

04:26.224 --> 04:29.394
And yet again... We do nothing.

04:29.477 --> 04:32.480
I don't believe Lady Kaguya Sumeragi
and the old factions

04:32.563 --> 04:34.816
<i>would have ever expected such a windfall.</i>

04:36.192 --> 04:38.695
<i>I suppose we did get some support.</i>

04:39.237 --> 04:41.406
In that alone, we were fortunate.

04:43.658 --> 04:45.034
<i>But the Princess...</i>

04:53.960 --> 04:56.337
I'm free!

04:59.299 --> 05:01.050
NEO-BRITANNIA GOVERNMENT OFFICE
IMPERIAL PALACE

05:01.134 --> 05:02.218
So to sum up,

05:02.302 --> 05:05.888
Young Narah and I were able to crush
the terrorist base between the two of us,

05:05.972 --> 05:07.598
while on the other hand...

05:09.058 --> 05:11.227
You all got slapped around, didn't you?

05:11.311 --> 05:12.312
How sad.

05:12.395 --> 05:14.230
No! You don't understand!

05:14.314 --> 05:16.983
The way they fought against us
was so cowardly!

05:17.066 --> 05:18.401
Don't. Stop right there.

05:18.484 --> 05:21.654
Those sorts of excuses
are exactly what he hates most.

05:21.738 --> 05:23.698
You volunteered to lead the assault

05:23.781 --> 05:26.617
with the aim of filling
young Arnold's shoes, and yet...

05:26.701 --> 05:28.536
<i>Instead of taking decisive action</i>

05:28.619 --> 05:31.581
<i>you allowed the enemy
to control the situation.</i>

05:31.664 --> 05:33.583
<i>Ultimately, all you succeeded in doing</i>

05:33.666 --> 05:38.296
<i>was elevating the name of
Kensei Kuroto's Seven Shining Stars.</i>

05:43.593 --> 05:45.678
Is that all you have to report?

05:47.305 --> 05:48.514
Heath,

05:49.182 --> 05:53.144
your presence is no longer required.

06:05.239 --> 06:06.449
NEO-BRITANNIA GOVERNMENT OFFICE
FRONT SHRINE

06:06.532 --> 06:08.910
Heath just killed himself.
We're now down to four.

06:08.993 --> 06:10.995
I can't keep these seats filled.

06:11.079 --> 06:12.121
Handle it.

06:12.205 --> 06:15.792
You're always saddling me
with troublesome tasks. Hmm?

06:16.417 --> 06:19.337
Natalia... How interesting.

06:20.338 --> 06:22.715
The only daughter
of the Luxembourg Family,

06:22.799 --> 06:25.551
and emigrated here
as Princess Sherry's aide.

06:25.635 --> 06:28.679
I believe that she was the one
who wrote up the application

06:28.763 --> 06:32.809
for that Eleven Special District
you recently approved on a whim.

06:32.892 --> 06:36.437
<i>While she is still in her teens,
she has taken over for her invalid father</i>

06:36.521 --> 06:38.106
<i>as the head of her family.</i>

06:38.189 --> 06:41.317
<i>She's become a central figure
within the administration.</i>

06:41.901 --> 06:45.780
Speaking of which... when the emperor
was on a tour of the area,

06:45.863 --> 06:48.408
<i>she protected him
during a terrorist attack.</i>

06:48.491 --> 06:52.453
<i>As a result, Emperor Callis
has grown quite attached to her.</i>

06:52.912 --> 06:56.082
She'll be a difficult one
to court.

06:59.210 --> 07:02.547
Hmm? No comment? Indifferent as ever...

07:02.630 --> 07:04.090
SEVEN SHINING STARS HAKODATE HIDEOUT

07:04.173 --> 07:05.174
Ready, set...

07:05.258 --> 07:06.759
Cheers!

07:06.843 --> 07:08.428
We're so badass!

07:08.511 --> 07:10.721
We totally kicked the crap
outta that Einberg today!

07:10.805 --> 07:13.391
It's not just us! Kuroto's leadership,

07:13.474 --> 07:14.851
Roze's strategy,

07:14.934 --> 07:17.812
and Ash's combat skills
helped us out as well!

07:17.895 --> 07:19.647
Hey, what about me?

07:19.730 --> 07:22.275
Mmm-hmm! You definitely helped out!

07:23.317 --> 07:25.278
We may have lost the Otaru base,

07:25.361 --> 07:29.282
but we've found a location that can
accommodate all the new Knightmares.

07:29.365 --> 07:30.575
So that's a relief.

07:30.658 --> 07:31.701
Yeah.

07:32.243 --> 07:35.872
So many sweet machines
to work on!

07:35.955 --> 07:38.207
Oh, yeah... Where'd those brothers go?

07:38.291 --> 07:40.585
They said they were gonna
take a couple days off.

07:40.668 --> 07:43.671
<i>Right after saying getting enough rest
was part of the job.</i>

07:45.173 --> 07:46.924
<i>197,</i>

07:47.008 --> 07:52.054
198, 199, 200.

07:56.309 --> 07:58.561
We're at your favorite time
of the day, huh?

08:00.730 --> 08:02.940
<i>All right, all right.</i>

08:03.524 --> 08:04.901
I'll open the door for you.

08:11.824 --> 08:14.035
Lady Natalia has arrived at the cafe.

08:16.662 --> 08:19.248
Uh... Should I reschedule?

08:19.874 --> 08:22.376
Mmm... No, it's fine.

08:22.460 --> 08:23.920
I'll get ready.

08:26.714 --> 08:29.717
I think... It's in here.

08:29.800 --> 08:32.386
Or not. Looks like we're out of food.

08:35.431 --> 08:36.557
Huh?

08:38.351 --> 08:39.727
Good morning, Natalia.

08:39.810 --> 08:41.187
Good morning, Rozé.

08:41.270 --> 08:44.148
Oh, Vallen,
can we have the place to ourselves?

08:44.232 --> 08:46.067
Of course, as you wish.

08:47.026 --> 08:48.861
I know you might be
the owner, Natalia,

08:48.945 --> 08:51.572
but your time is important,
so let's make this quick.

08:53.699 --> 08:56.953
Wow. So it can even change your eye color.

08:57.036 --> 08:59.288
Things are less uncomfortable
this way, right?

08:59.372 --> 09:00.581
They are.

09:01.165 --> 09:02.458
Princess Sakuya,

09:02.542 --> 09:04.126
would you like a cup of tea?

09:04.210 --> 09:05.586
Thanks, I'd love one.

09:05.670 --> 09:07.129
And how about dessert?

09:07.213 --> 09:08.881
Maybe... the raspberry pie?

09:08.965 --> 09:13.010
Sincerest apologies, Your Majesty,
but we're out of the raspberry pie.

09:13.094 --> 09:14.887
Oh! I'll go buy some!

09:17.598 --> 09:20.768
Natalia, have you found out
anything about Sakura yet?

09:21.310 --> 09:24.647
Not much. We know she's being held
in a government facility right now.

09:25.314 --> 09:27.733
But I haven't been able
to pinpoint her location.

09:28.985 --> 09:31.404
<i>The military has classified it
as confidential.</i>

09:31.946 --> 09:34.574
<i>I thought about asking if the Emperor
could arrange a meeting,</i>

09:34.657 --> 09:37.159
<i>but it seems wiser not to.</i>

09:37.952 --> 09:39.912
<i>I'm worried it could backfire.</i>

09:39.996 --> 09:42.623
<i>Especially with someone
like Norland involved.</i>

09:44.584 --> 09:49.171
Anyway... Enough about classified things.
Have you been able to rest much?

09:49.255 --> 09:52.592
I have! It's hard to believe
how much I've slept.

09:53.426 --> 09:56.679
I've been out like a light.
I didn't get that phrase before.

09:56.762 --> 10:00.099
It's hard to do that resistance work
while maintaining your disguise.

10:00.182 --> 10:02.184
It's the stress melting away.

10:02.268 --> 10:04.478
Yes. Maybe that's it.

10:04.562 --> 10:06.647
<i>No. I know it's not.</i>

10:07.648 --> 10:11.902
<i>The Power of Absolute Obedience.
My Geass' power.</i>

10:13.154 --> 10:16.490
<i>I remember him saying
that the Power of Kings would isolate me.</i>

10:17.992 --> 10:20.244
<i>I guess this is what he meant.</i>

10:20.328 --> 10:23.623
<i>No one can know about this.
It's my secret.</i>

10:24.540 --> 10:26.208
Are you okay?

10:26.292 --> 10:29.211
Has there been anything else
that's been weighing on your mind?

10:29.295 --> 10:30.963
Not at all. I'm fine!

10:31.547 --> 10:35.009
Hey... What do you say
to trying something new?

10:36.761 --> 10:38.554
Uh... What is this?

10:39.013 --> 10:42.308
Isn't it nice to wear
something feminine from time to time?

10:42.391 --> 10:44.644
I guess. But this isn't really...

10:44.727 --> 10:48.731
You still get to enjoy your freedom,
and I get another pair of hands.

10:48.814 --> 10:51.067
That is a win-win as far as I'm concerned.

10:51.150 --> 10:53.986
That sounds
like something you'd think of.

10:54.070 --> 10:55.237
Ugh.

10:55.696 --> 10:57.531
Looks like the government wants me.

10:59.575 --> 11:00.576
Hey...

11:00.660 --> 11:03.746
Now, I'm expecting you
to put in your best.

11:03.829 --> 11:05.164
All right, Princess?

11:05.289 --> 11:06.540
I'll be off!

11:07.375 --> 11:09.669
All right then. See you later.

11:10.294 --> 11:12.004
Look at this cutie in the dress.

11:12.088 --> 11:13.547
You work at a cafe or somethin'?

11:13.631 --> 11:17.218
Elevens like you have a lot of nerve
holding down decent jobs.

11:17.301 --> 11:18.302
I know, right?

11:18.386 --> 11:19.595
Leave me alone!

11:19.679 --> 11:22.223
This district recognizes
Japanese people as--

11:22.306 --> 11:24.517
You're not Japanese. You're an Eleven.

11:24.600 --> 11:26.686
- You better lose that attitude!
- Come with us.

11:26.769 --> 11:27.770
Is there a problem here?

11:28.479 --> 11:29.480
Get lost!

11:34.985 --> 11:36.612
I neutralized your problem.

11:37.196 --> 11:39.156
You're free to keep going about your day.

11:39.240 --> 11:40.241
Goodbye.

11:44.120 --> 11:45.121
<i>Um...</i>

11:46.539 --> 11:49.333
Do I look weird? This feels weird.

11:49.417 --> 11:51.252
It suits you quite well.

11:54.296 --> 11:55.589
Sorry I'm so late!

11:55.673 --> 11:58.008
I ran into some weirdos on the way back.

11:58.092 --> 12:01.220
Oh! But this gentleman came to my rescue!

12:01.303 --> 12:03.848
Meet my hero! This is Ash.

12:05.349 --> 12:06.350
<i>Huh?</i>

12:07.101 --> 12:08.102
<i>Huh?</i>

12:08.728 --> 12:10.730
<i>Of all the times to show up!</i>

12:11.480 --> 12:13.357
Uh... There's a new girl?

12:13.441 --> 12:15.901
Yes. She started work today.

12:16.444 --> 12:18.904
Nice to meet you, sir.

12:26.120 --> 12:27.204
Lady Natalia.

12:27.830 --> 12:30.207
A thousand apologies
for summoning you here.

12:30.291 --> 12:32.626
Has something happened
to Emperor Callis?

12:38.424 --> 12:40.134
Hmm?

12:40.217 --> 12:42.136
Lady Natalia
has arrived for you.

12:44.221 --> 12:45.431
Natalia!

12:45.890 --> 12:47.975
I'm so sorry to keep you waiting.

12:48.809 --> 12:50.853
Wait, what! So that guy is your--

12:50.936 --> 12:51.937
Shush!

12:52.021 --> 12:53.022
I'm so sorry.

12:53.105 --> 12:55.441
If I'd known,
I never would've brought him!

12:57.610 --> 12:59.195
He's totally staring at you.

12:59.653 --> 13:02.364
I'll go gauge things with him. Back me up.

13:02.448 --> 13:04.074
I'm right behind you!

13:05.075 --> 13:06.744
Would you like some more coffee?

13:06.827 --> 13:09.079
- Oh, yes please.
- Sure.

13:10.539 --> 13:13.000
- Uh, so, wha... what is your name?
- Huh?

13:13.083 --> 13:14.752
She goes by Raspberry!

13:14.835 --> 13:16.754
<i>That's not the kinda "backup" I meant!</i>

13:16.837 --> 13:18.255
Raspberry...

13:18.881 --> 13:20.090
That's a beautiful name.

13:20.174 --> 13:21.175
Huh?

13:21.258 --> 13:22.843
Uh, I mean...

13:22.927 --> 13:24.512
What's your favorite food?

13:24.595 --> 13:26.931
I love to eat and I'm a good cook too.

13:27.014 --> 13:28.974
My specialty is wild herb dishes.

13:29.058 --> 13:31.101
I have some puppies and kittens at home,

13:31.185 --> 13:33.729
and they go through food really quickly
since they're still growing.

13:33.813 --> 13:35.523
Usually, I have to buy their food in bulk.

13:35.606 --> 13:37.691
I'm away from home a lot
and they still need to eat.

13:37.775 --> 13:40.152
And it's not like human food is any good
for them, so I can't

13:40.236 --> 13:41.695
leave them my leftovers.
<i>Wow.</i>

13:41.779 --> 13:44.698
<i>I never would've guessed
he could talk this much.</i>

13:44.782 --> 13:47.910
<i>He only communicates the bare minimum
when I'm Rozé...</i>

13:48.702 --> 13:51.413
<i>Well, it doesn't seem like he's noticed
that it's me yet.</i>

13:51.872 --> 13:53.040
<i>In that case...</i>

13:53.123 --> 13:57.002
If you care this much about animals,
you must be a really kind man.

13:58.170 --> 14:00.714
<i>He's chugging red-hot coffee!</i>

14:00.798 --> 14:03.175
Another, please!
<i>Now he's going for a third cup?</i>

14:03.634 --> 14:06.053
So, did you move here with your parents?

14:06.136 --> 14:07.763
My family brought me here.

14:07.847 --> 14:10.766
My mother passed away,
but I still have my younger brother.

14:10.850 --> 14:11.976
Do you have any siblings?

14:12.059 --> 14:13.102
<i>Is he probing?</i>

14:13.435 --> 14:15.604
She does not! But she's my second cousin!

14:16.021 --> 14:18.399
<i>That's just a big mess
of half-truths!</i>

14:18.482 --> 14:19.483
It's meant to be.

14:19.567 --> 14:22.069
I never would've guessed
that you two were cousins.

14:25.447 --> 14:27.783
Thanks for your help,
but I should be good for now.

14:27.867 --> 14:28.868
Roger!

14:28.951 --> 14:29.952
Um...

14:31.453 --> 14:32.746
Another please!

14:34.748 --> 14:35.749
<i>I see.</i>

14:35.833 --> 14:39.211
This cafe you speak of
sounds like quite the fascinating place.

14:39.295 --> 14:41.380
You can visit whenever you like.

14:41.463 --> 14:42.673
You're more than welcome.

14:43.799 --> 14:47.219
I would, but Japanese go there, correct?

14:47.303 --> 14:49.179
I'm afraid of such people.

14:49.930 --> 14:54.101
Though, I guess if I think about it,
I'm more afraid of Norland.

14:54.184 --> 14:55.728
Whenever he glares at me,

14:55.811 --> 14:58.439
it feels like my heart is being crushed.

14:58.522 --> 14:59.607
Your Highness...

15:00.566 --> 15:03.861
What do you think
about opening a cafe here, just for you?

15:04.945 --> 15:06.030
You mean it?

15:06.113 --> 15:08.908
Yes! I want it to serve
hot cocoa and sweets!

15:08.991 --> 15:10.868
Well, then, it shall be done.

15:10.951 --> 15:13.579
I'm certain it will lift your spirits,
Your Highness.

15:14.663 --> 15:15.998
More coffee please!

15:16.081 --> 15:18.542
Sure.
<i>That's his tenth cup!</i>

15:18.959 --> 15:22.046
You know, I bet
that you're good around animals.

15:22.129 --> 15:24.089
They don't seem
to warm up to me that much.

15:24.506 --> 15:26.508
They always flock to my younger brother.

15:26.592 --> 15:29.011
I've been trying to find ways
to make them like me more.

15:29.094 --> 15:31.805
<i>He doesn't</i> seem <i>like
he's a bad person...</i>

15:32.640 --> 15:35.017
Wait, what did you just say?

15:36.393 --> 15:39.688
I did it. Jugo Sumeragi...

15:39.772 --> 15:41.190
I killed him.

15:44.401 --> 15:47.404
Wa... Was there something wrong
with what I said?

15:48.739 --> 15:49.740
Uh...

15:50.157 --> 15:51.617
Oh!

15:52.368 --> 15:54.161
I should really be heading back.

15:55.204 --> 15:57.539
May... May I come again?

15:58.666 --> 16:00.292
I look forward to it.

16:06.173 --> 16:09.343
Hello there, Princess Sakuya Sumeragi.

16:09.718 --> 16:13.347
So, starting now, I have the honor
of being your personal knight.

16:13.430 --> 16:15.641
I'm the White Queen of Einberg,

16:15.724 --> 16:17.810
Catherine Sabathra.

16:18.894 --> 16:21.397
That's all.
Pleased to make your acquaintance.

16:22.064 --> 16:24.233
Yes, I'm pleased to meet you as well.

16:24.316 --> 16:25.401
Just so you know,

16:25.484 --> 16:28.946
I can't say that I'm a very big fan
of this new appointment.

16:29.029 --> 16:32.074
I mean, seriously?
You're half-Eleven and a princess

16:32.157 --> 16:33.826
that needs protecting on top of that.

16:33.909 --> 16:35.077
You're weak!

16:35.160 --> 16:37.413
The worst! I hate you.

16:38.288 --> 16:40.249
But Commander Norland is so strong!

16:40.332 --> 16:41.458
The best!

16:41.542 --> 16:42.543
Love him.

16:43.877 --> 16:45.754
So, I'll do my job like I'm told.

16:46.255 --> 16:49.091
You may find me to be a bit harsh
every now and again.

16:49.174 --> 16:50.759
Try not to let it get to you.

16:51.844 --> 16:52.928
Right.

16:53.012 --> 16:55.305
Well then, if you'll excuse me.

16:56.056 --> 16:57.266
See ya.

16:59.810 --> 17:03.105
<i>It doesn't seem like anyone's
caught on that I'm a decoy yet.</i>

17:03.939 --> 17:06.191
<i>As long as I keep playing my role,</i>

17:06.275 --> 17:08.402
<i>it will ensure Sakuya's safety.</i>

17:09.236 --> 17:10.904
<i>I have to believe that.</i>

17:12.656 --> 17:13.991
What's the status?

17:14.074 --> 17:16.201
Progress is at 87%.

17:16.285 --> 17:20.539
We have to take all possibilities
into consideration, so I need more time.

17:20.622 --> 17:24.293
Very well. Take however much you need.

17:29.506 --> 17:30.507
So?

17:30.591 --> 17:32.801
Were you able to enjoy yourself?

17:32.885 --> 17:34.344
Uh... I guess so.

17:34.887 --> 17:38.515
I really wish that you'd stop
involving yourself with the resistance.

17:39.016 --> 17:41.143
But I know it's pointless to ask you to.

17:49.818 --> 17:51.695
Please, help me.

17:52.404 --> 17:54.490
I want to save Sakura.

17:58.911 --> 18:01.413
I promise. I'll do what I can to help.

18:02.998 --> 18:04.416
And I will too!

18:06.168 --> 18:08.545
I'm so lucky. Thank you.

18:11.006 --> 18:13.092
Hey, Natalia.
- Huh?

18:13.926 --> 18:16.011
Is it okay if I come back?

18:17.012 --> 18:20.432
Of course you can! You're always welcome.

18:20.516 --> 18:23.310
After all, the cafe is your home, too.

18:41.995 --> 18:43.622
Fetch a doctor! Hurry!

18:43.705 --> 18:45.290
Emperor Callis!
Can you hear me?

18:45.374 --> 18:46.416
Emperor Callis!

18:47.584 --> 18:48.919
Done with your break?

18:49.002 --> 18:50.921
Yup, returning to duty.

18:51.004 --> 18:53.132
The units we ordered just came in.

18:53.549 --> 18:54.842
Oh! Really?

18:56.426 --> 18:59.304
This is the Black Knights'
new Knightmare Frame, Sekka.

18:59.388 --> 19:02.641
And the customizable ace unit, Keisetsu.

19:02.724 --> 19:05.519
Wow, an ace, huh?
Really gets your heart pumpin'!

19:05.602 --> 19:06.687
Really?

19:06.770 --> 19:09.022
Sure, I know that this new model
has way better specs

19:09.106 --> 19:10.607
compared to the Akatsukis,

19:10.691 --> 19:12.317
but the normal one is more than enough.

19:12.401 --> 19:13.819
Where's your sense of adventure?

19:14.403 --> 19:18.073
It's every pilot's dream
to have a fully customized ace unit.

19:18.157 --> 19:21.118
Hey! Who's supposed to be
our ace pilot anyway?

19:21.201 --> 19:22.744
Mr. Kuroto!

19:22.828 --> 19:25.080
Have you decided
who our ace pilot is gonna be yet?

19:25.497 --> 19:26.874
Not yet.

19:26.957 --> 19:29.793
It seems like there'll be hard feelings
if one of you picks.

19:29.877 --> 19:32.796
Would you like the outsider here
to make the objective choice?

19:32.880 --> 19:34.173
That's a good idea.

19:34.256 --> 19:36.758
Shall we? Let's leave the decision to him.

19:37.926 --> 19:39.136
Very well.

19:41.597 --> 19:44.975
Well, if you don't like my decision,
you can always change it.

19:45.058 --> 19:47.019
Hey, Rozé!
- Huh?

19:47.102 --> 19:49.646
The Artemis just got here, too!

19:50.147 --> 19:53.400
It'll be my first time doing maintenance
on a flying Knightmare.

19:53.483 --> 19:55.152
My heart is pounding!

19:55.485 --> 19:57.029
So they finished it...

19:57.112 --> 20:00.199
I'll be able to support you directly
with this, big brother.

20:00.282 --> 20:03.285
That's it. No more flying tandem
in the Apollo.

20:03.744 --> 20:05.245
Doing that is gonna kill me.

20:05.329 --> 20:07.080
Yeah. Sorry about that.

20:21.386 --> 20:24.723
So, uh...
Do anything fun with your time off?

20:24.806 --> 20:26.308
No, not really...

20:27.726 --> 20:28.936
Did you?

20:29.019 --> 20:30.812
Yeah, I think so.

20:30.896 --> 20:33.899
And preparations seem to be
chugging along for our next plan.

20:34.816 --> 20:35.943
I see...

20:39.196 --> 20:40.364
Hey, Rozé...

20:40.822 --> 20:41.823
Hmm?

20:42.574 --> 20:45.661
I think... I might be in love.

20:45.744 --> 20:46.954
Hmm.

20:49.248 --> 20:50.374
What!

20:50.958 --> 20:53.335
<i>Whoa, wait, hold on.
Does that mean...</i>

20:55.879 --> 20:57.881
<i>A statement from the Imperial Palace.</i>

20:58.757 --> 21:02.928
<i>Our 100th Emperor, Callis al Britannia,
has just passed away.</i>

21:05.472 --> 21:06.974
<i>Now with an update.</i>

21:07.057 --> 21:10.269
<i>The Imperial Palace has just released
a second announcement.</i>

21:10.352 --> 21:13.272
<i>Sakuya Sumeragi me Britannia
will ascend to the throne</i>

21:13.355 --> 21:15.148
<i>as the 101st Empress.</i>

21:15.232 --> 21:17.317
- Wait, what?
- Princess Sakuya?

21:17.401 --> 21:19.152
<i>If you have just tuned in,</i>

21:19.236 --> 21:21.947
<i>the Imperial Palace has announced
that our 100th Emperor...</i>

21:22.030 --> 21:23.240
I can't believe this.

21:23.323 --> 21:26.243
<i>...Callis al Britannia
has just passed away.</i>

21:26.326 --> 21:30.998
<i>As a result, Sakuya Sumeragi me Britannia
will be ascending to the throne</i>

21:31.081 --> 21:33.166
<i>as the 101st Empress.</i>

21:57.482 --> 21:58.734
<i>Sakura...</i>

21:59.359 --> 22:02.279
<i>Just when I thought
I was getting so close...</i>

22:06.867 --> 22:09.286
Do you desire power?

22:09.786 --> 22:12.456
The power of the king
will condemn you to solitude.

22:13.790 --> 22:16.501
It will drive away
those most precious to you.

22:19.046 --> 22:20.589
<i>Could this be...</i>

22:23.300 --> 22:24.843
<i>what he meant?</i>
